  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/4390de5e-c919-42bc-a03c-cff4b8edc61e.png\" style=\"width: 380px; height: 217px;\" /></p><p>The displacement is the hypotenuse of the diameter and the distance travelled for half the rotation&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#960;</mi><mi>R</mi></math>.</p><p>By using Pythagoras theorem,</p><p>Displacement of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>R</mi><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>&#960;</mi><mi>R</mi><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mi>R</mi><msqrt><msup><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></msqrt></math></p></blockquote>",
